@ Start

- Melusina
  The tide in the sky is turning. I can feel the shorewake pulling toward the high balcony.

- Sir Melodious
  The celestial current is attuned to your song, Melusina. Take the Shorewake Weave and board the Starskiff when you are ready.

* Accept the Shorewake Weave and prepare to depart. | -> AcceptWeave
* Inquire about the Sea Above currents.             | -> InquireCurrents

<@> InquireCurrents

- Melusina
  The water above reflects no stars, only resonance.

- Sir Melodious
  It is a living sea. The Shorewake fabric will stabilize your buoyancy across the sky.

-> AcceptWeave

<@> AcceptWeave

- Melusina
  The fabric aligns with the skyward tide. The current feels weightless against my hands.

$ Notify melodia:item:give:item.outfit.shorewake:1
$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.shorewake.resonance:melodia_resonance:5
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.quest.shorewake_completed:true
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.sea_above.starskiff_ready:true

- Sir Melodious
  The resonance holds! The Starskiff is anchored at the overlook mooring and ready for your command.

$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.shorewake.initiation:flag.quest.shorewake_completed:reward.shorewake_weave:intent.shorewake.complete:checkpoint.shorewake.complete

@ Finish

- .
  Melusina attunes to the Shorewake. Traversal aboard the Starskiff is unlocked.

$ End
